# Portugal satellite — no thin household guides

## Do not publish as standalone notes

- Consumer returns / product warranty (`vozvrat`, garantia de bens)
- One-fact transit news (e.g. free STCP Porto) without checklist / nuances
- One-shot tech tips (broken Via Verde transponder)
- Single-paragraph Q&A that belongs in FAQ of a system guide (e.g. change NIF morada alone)

These are in `ARCHIVE_SLUGS` / `isThinHouseholdTopic` (`lib/community-notes/editorial-filter.ts`).

## Do instead

- Fold into a **system** guide (portagens, renovação AIMA, first month, domestic tourism)
- Or skip — easy Google / EU consumer law is not Emigro inventory

## If user pastes such a draft

Refuse to ship as a new `/notes/…` guide; offer a short FAQ bullet in the parent guide only.
